{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580459-beast-fan-made-nightmare","id":580459,"title":"[Beast] fan made nightmare","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-05T19:44:14-07:00","id":580459,"title":"[Beast] fan made nightmare","content":"So after a little thinking I just thought of a brand new kinship for now its called rent unless someone has a better name.<br /> <br /> Iets just give an example:<br /> say a beast just happens to approach a group of mages or strix or even a an entire court and goes hey wanna rent or have my chamber if they say yes well that chamber now belongs to them. <br /> <br /> What happens to the lair?<br /> the chamber is now being used by the supernatural meaning they can impose whatever lair or tilt they want for example if it belongs to a mekhet then the lair gains tilts like darkness, exposed and echoing if it belongs to a werewolf pack then it becomes crushing, mirages or even viscous ill leave that to whatever design you deciede it to be.<br /> <br /> What happens to the supernatural?<br /> The throng now have thier own lair to live or hide also said supernatural now have several new powers firsr off they gain kinship powers such as skeleton key for mages or geists who want easy access to the astral plain or underworld hold the door so invictus vampire can show off her new home or if its a ordo dracul invite students into a field trip through whar ever they use skeleton key for whatever reason they plan on doing and finally be my guest well now said owner of said chamber who owes you debt can simply hide out in your freinds chamber from the scary seven when they come into town. The last thing to add is like beasts they can now impose tilts. So yeah quite a lot of advantages from renting one lair also just a warning from the beast he only let you have acess to one chamber meaning if you were to enter another chamber please be prepared to peppered by swarms or burnt to a crisp in order to gain access to that part or several of the other parts he needs to the beast to open the door for him.<br /> <br /> What happens to the beast?<br /> well the beast just gave away a chamber to any supernatural mentioned and more what does the beast gain well the beast now have free acess to study a mage or promthean and free nightmares ahoy also the heroes not gonna like walking into a pack of strix or a werewolf pack and I am pretty sure the strix would not like that you just entered the nest and would've like said hero to leave/burn/eaten or anything else.<br /> <br /> so what do you think","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T20:22:13-07:00","id":580487,"title":"","content":"I think it's an interesting concept, but maybe it's not got enough factors to balance it? Like, maybe renting a Chamber offers a steady source of Satiety, but it reduces their maximum Satiety by one dot for as long as it's rented?<br /> <br /> Also, this post was a little tough to read. You have a lot of run-on sentences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T20:34:14-07:00","id":580498,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580459-beast-fan-made-nightmare?p=580487#post580487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it's an interesting concept, but maybe it's not got enough factors to balance it? Like, maybe renting a Chamber offers a steady source of Satiety, but it reduces their maximum Satiety by one dot for as long as it's rented?<br /> <br /> Also, this post was a little tough to read. You have a lot of run-on sentences.</div> </div> </div> </div>Laptops broken had to resort to using a phone but yeah I agree with what your saying but the whole renting a supernatural in was considered a balance your supposed to believe hope whoever was renting let in say a hero or other dark creatures. For example lets say you let a high humanity vampire in and now this nice vampire just let in his not so nice eldar who would be interested in turning the chamber into his own personal castle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T20:51:25-07:00","id":580504,"title":"","content":"I feel like this sort of thing is better represented with an individual supernatural being or a group thereof having figured out a way to claim control of a particular Chamber through either general plot-based metaphysics or developing the trick via bloodline/legacy/Cipher/what-have-you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T23:39:22-07:00","id":580578,"title":"","content":"Or an atavism, something like Dungeon Master:<br /> <br /> Normal Effect- The Beast can share a chamber with a specific supernatural or group of supernaturals. These boarders can leave, enter, and summon a chamber just like a beast.<br /> <br /> Low satiety- The boarders can now replace chamber traits with traits more appropriate to their nature, as if they were a beast of the same lair trait as their native power trait, minimum of one, and the beast can channel these lair traits just as if these supernaturals were a beast in their brood. <br /> <br /> Satiety expenditure- The borders benefit from a lair resonance like condition. When their environment resonates with their chamber, the boarders can activate their supernatural abilities with willpower instead of vitae, essence, etc, once per scene per level of power trait, minimum of one.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T06:34:54-07:00","id":580876,"title":"","content":"It seems more like a power that would be in the same category as Be My Guest rather than a Nightmare or Atavism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T06:51:53-07:00","id":580896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580459-beast-fan-made-nightmare?p=580876#post580876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It seems more like a power that would be in the same category as Be My Guest rather than a Nightmare or Atavism.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was actually kinship but for some strange reason I can't change the title I am afraid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T22:30:50-07:00","id":581966,"title":"","content":"Not to be a wet blanket, but it's way too strong to be a free kinship power in my opinion.<br /> <br /> Hence my suggestion for an atavism, or barring that go with Satchel's idea of it being a blood magic/rote/whatever on the supernatural's part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T22:40:12-07:00","id":581968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580459-beast-fan-made-nightmare?p=581966#post581966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Satchel's idea of it being a blood magic/rote/whatever on the supernatural's part.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like, it's not even just because that's an established headspace for weird other-supernatural nonsense that may or may not reference stuff from other gamelines \u2014 the noted tendency of other supernaturals to not make the connection that a Raptor and a Leviathan (or even a Giant and a Giant) are the same class of being dovetails nicely into the notable chunk of bloodlines/Legacies/Entitlements/etc built around a founder's encounter with a Weird Nebulous Monster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-06T23:21:10-07:00","id":581985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/580459-beast-fan-made-nightmare?p=581966#post581966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not to be a wet blanket, but it's way too strong to be a free kinship power in my opinion.<br /> <br /> Hence my suggestion for an atavism, or barring that go with Satchel's idea of it being a blood magic/rote/whatever on the supernatural's part.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreeing with both satchel and st to an extent I think I can make a atavism but what group would I put this in for families. Also seeing that this is a very strong power I guess this would belong to an incarnate or a merger if were going with the whole bloodline/legacies/lodges.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-07T07:01:40-07:00","id":582235,"title":"","content":"Offhand, I'd make it a makara atavism, mermaids and the like being able to share the seas despite the fact that most people aren't good at breathing underwater is hardly unknown in the myths.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}